public static class FlexTest {
 static int checks;static void Check(bool b,string t){checks++;if(!b)throw new Exception(t);}static void Near(float a,float b,string t){Check(Math.Abs(a-b)<.0001,t+": "+a+" / "+b);}
 static ModuleRWCollapsibleTube Setup(float extent=0){var p=new Part();p.transforms["RW_TubeNose"]=new UnityEngine.Transform();p.transforms["RW_TubeBellows"]=new UnityEngine.Transform();p.nodes["top"]=new AttachNode();p.nodes["bottom"]=new AttachNode{position=new UnityEngine.Vector3(-.6f,0,0)};p.modules.Add(new ModuleDockingNode{part=p,referenceAttachNode="top"});var m=new ModuleRWCollapsibleTube{part=p,extension=extent,targetExtension=extent};m.OnLoad(new ConfigNode());m.OnStart(StartState.None);m.OnStartFinished(StartState.None);return m;}
 static void Tick(ModuleRWCollapsibleTube m,int n=400){for(int i=0;i<n;i++)m.FixedUpdate();}
 static void Pose(ModuleRWCollapsibleTube m,float t){Near(m.extension,t,"saved deployment");Near(m.part.transforms["RW_TubeNose"].localPosition.x,.6f+2.8f*t,"moving port parent");Near(m.part.nodes["top"].position.x,.6f+2.8f*t,"attachment and docking parent agree");Near(m.part.nodes["top"].originalPosition.x,.6f+2.8f*t,"original node matches pose");Near(m.part.transforms["RW_TubeBellows"].localScale.x,(.9f+2.8f*t)/.9f,"pressure shell and nested collider scale");Near(m.part.nodes["bottom"].position.x,-.6f,"fixed rear node never moves");}
 public static void Run(){
  new ModuleRWCollapsibleTube().OnStart(StartState.None);new ModuleRWCollapsibleTube().FixedUpdate();Check(true,"missing part safe");
  var m=Setup();Pose(m,0);m.part.nodes["bottom"].attachedPart=new Part();m.Extend();Tick(m,100);Check(m.extension>0&&m.extension<1,"smooth intermediate motion with rear anchored");Tick(m);Pose(m,1);Check(m.status.Contains("4.0"),"extended status");m.Collapse();Tick(m);Pose(m,0);
  foreach(float t in new[]{0f,.25f,.5f,.75f,1f}){m=Setup(t);Pose(m,t);Check(m.targetExtension==t,"reload keeps intermediate target");}
  foreach(string reason in new[]{"attach","other","uid","docked","acquire"}){
   m=Setup(.5f);var p=m.part.FindModulesImplementing<ModuleDockingNode>()[0];if(reason=="attach")m.part.nodes["top"].attachedPart=new Part();if(reason=="other")p.otherNode=new ModuleDockingNode();if(reason=="uid")p.dockedPartUId=5;if(reason=="docked")p.state="Docked (docker)";if(reason=="acquire")p.state="Acquire";m.Extend();Tick(m);Pose(m,.5f);Check(m.Events["Extend"].active&&m.Events["Collapse"].active,"busy end keeps controls visible: "+reason);m.Extend();Check(m.status.Contains("Undock"),"busy end explains lock");
  }
  m=Setup();m.Extend();Tick(m,100);float stopped=m.extension;m.part.nodes["top"].attachedPart=new Part();Tick(m);Pose(m,stopped);Check(m.targetExtension==m.extension,"connection arriving mid-motion stops target");m.part.nodes["top"].attachedPart=null;m.Extend();Tick(m);Pose(m,1);
  foreach(string reason in new[]{"packed","unloaded","warp"}){m=Setup();m.Extend();if(reason=="packed")m.vessel.packed=true;if(reason=="unloaded")m.vessel.loaded=false;if(reason=="warp")TimeWarp.CurrentRateIndex=1;Tick(m);Pose(m,0);TimeWarp.CurrentRateIndex=0;}
  m=Setup(float.NaN);Pose(m,0);m=Setup(float.PositiveInfinity);Pose(m,0);m=Setup(5);Pose(m,1);m=Setup(-3);Pose(m,0);
  HighLogic.LoadedSceneIsFlight=false;HighLogic.LoadedSceneIsEditor=true;EditorLogic.fetch=new EditorLogic();m=Setup();m.Extend();for(int i=0;i<400;i++)m.Update();Pose(m,1);Check(GameEvents.onEditorShipModified.calls==1,"editor refresh at completed deployment");HighLogic.LoadedSceneIsFlight=true;HighLogic.LoadedSceneIsEditor=false;
  var owner=new Part();var source=new ModuleLight{part=owner,lightName="RW_GreenhouseInspectionLight",isOn=false};owner.modules.Add(source);owner.renderers.Add(new UnityEngine.Renderer{name="RW_EndWindows"});owner.renderers.Add(new UnityEngine.Renderer{name="OtherWindow"});var link=new ModuleRWEndWindowLink{part=owner};link.OnStart(StartState.None);Near(owner.renderers[0].color.r,0,"end window initially dark");source.isOn=true;link.LateUpdate();Near(owner.renderers[0].color.r,.93f,"follows inspection on");Near(owner.renderers[0].color.g,.84f,"warm white green");Near(owner.renderers[0].color.b,.67f,"warm white blue");Check(owner.renderers[0].other==123,"preserves other material block properties");Near(owner.renderers[1].color.r,0,"unrelated renderer unchanged");source.isOn=false;link.LateUpdate();Near(owner.renderers[0].color.r,0,"switch off clears glow");
  new ModuleRWEndWindowLink().OnStart(StartState.None);new ModuleRWEndWindowLink().LateUpdate();Check(true,"missing light/renderer safe");
  foreach(bool editor in new[]{false,true}){HighLogic.LoadedSceneIsEditor=editor;HighLogic.LoadedSceneIsFlight=!editor;m=Setup();m.Events["Extend"].active=false;m.Events["Extend"].guiActive=false;m.Events["Extend"].guiActiveEditor=false;m.LateUpdate();Check(m.Events["Extend"].active&&m.Events["Extend"].guiActive&&m.Events["Extend"].guiActiveEditor,"menu reopen restores both scene controls");}
  var latePart=new Part();latePart.nodes["top"]=new AttachNode();latePart.nodes["bottom"]=new AttachNode{position=new UnityEngine.Vector3(-.6f,0,0)};var late=new ModuleRWCollapsibleTube{part=latePart};late.Events.Clear();late.OnLoad(new ConfigNode());latePart.transforms["RW_TubeNose"]=new UnityEngine.Transform();latePart.transforms["RW_TubeBellows"]=new UnityEngine.Transform();late.Events["Extend"]=new Control();late.Events["Collapse"]=new Control();late.OnStartFinished(StartState.None);late.Extend();for(int i=0;i<400;i++)late.Update();Pose(late,1);Check(late.Events["Extend"].active,"late-bound model/PAW initializes safely");
  Console.WriteLine("PASS "+checks+" collapsible-tube/light assertions: visible editor/flight controls and lock messages, late model/event binding, fixed rear, moving node/collider, reload, connection locks, greenhouse light link");
 }
}
